ociates, showroom consultants, and e-commerce channels. Ferguson Enterprises Inc. was founded in 1953 and is headquartered in Newport News, Virginia.","fullTimeEmployees":35000,"city":"Newport News","country":"United States","website":"https://www.corporate.ferguson.com","industry":"Industrial Distribution","sector":"Industrials"},"news":[],"info_date":"2026-10-31"}